# The Mali-T880 on the station (2026-11-02-mali-t880-first-job). Panfrost, the
# VGPU regulator, the MFG clock and the DRM core are modules, and nothing loads
# them at boot. Panfrost selects IOMMU_SUPPORT and IOMMU_IO_PGTABLE_LPAE, which
# are built in and are the reason this needs a boot image. Keep the IOMMU drivers
# that exposes off: the GPU has its own MMU and M4U has no GPU port.
CONFIG_DRM=m
CONFIG_DRM_PANFROST=m
CONFIG_REGULATOR_RT5735=m
CONFIG_COMMON_CLK_MT6797_MFGSYS=m
CONFIG_IOMMU_SUPPORT=y
# CONFIG_ARM_SMMU is not set
# CONFIG_ARM_SMMU_V3 is not set
# CONFIG_IOMMU_IO_PGTABLE_ARMV7S is not set
# CONFIG_IOMMU_IO_PGTABLE_DART is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_FBDEV_EMULATION is not set
# Enabling DRM exposes defconfig's other display and GPU drivers. Nothing here uses them.
# CONFIG_DRM_CDNS_DSI is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_CDNS_MHDP8546 is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_DISPLAY_CONNECTOR is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_ETNAVIV is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_HDLCD is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_HISI_KIRIN is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_I2C_ADV7511 is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_I2C_NXP_TDA998X is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_ITE_IT6263 is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_ITE_IT66121 is not set
